// Groups the plugin and its examples for an editor and a repository-wide
// go test. No replace directives: each go.mod pins what it uses.
//
// ./examples is left out until runtime-go's events module and its
// grpc/problem and grpc/idempotency packages are on main: the generated code
// the examples compile imports them, so until then the examples build only in
// a workspace that also uses a local runtime-go checkout (README,
// "Developing"). Add ./examples back, and pin those modules in
// examples/go.mod with `go get ...@main`, once they are pushed.
go 1.26.5

use .
